{#- Voice Othos's prompt layout for llama3.2 on llama-server (llm_server.py).
    The same words as Ollama's llama3.2 template, with one change: the tool text goes into the newest message, never
    into the instructions block at the top. So the top of the prompt is the same on every turn, with tools offered or
    not, and llama-server reuses what it has already read instead of reading the whole call again.
    (Idea: "keep each conversation's cache" from colibri by Vincenzo Fornaro, Apache-2.0; no colibri code is used.)
    Only the first system message goes at the top; a later one stays where it was said. -#}
